            <div
              class="relative z-10 mx-8 flex flex-col gap-8 rounded-element border border-border-muted bg-surface-base p-inset-card pb-24 md:mx-20 md:p-inset-container md:pb-28 _letter_b6ed82"
            >
              <p
                class="text-subtitle-1 text-fg-secondary text-pretty"
                data-slot="text"
              >
                A founder, a team lead, someone in HR, or the head of a student project. If you lead people, you shape how they talk to each other.
              </p>
              <ol
                class="flex flex-col gap-6"
              >
                <li
                  class="flex flex-col gap-1"
                >
                  <span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="font-handwrite text-subtitle-handwrite-2 pointer-events-none block w-fit select-none -rotate-3 _writeOn_85273a text-action-tertiary"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    step 1
                  </span>
                  <h3
                    class="text-subtitle-2"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    Bring your team in
                  </h3>
                  <p
                    class="text-body-2 text-fg-secondary text-pretty"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    Sign in, create a Workspace for your team, and invite people by email.
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li
                  class="flex flex-col gap-1"
                >
                  <span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="font-handwrite text-subtitle-handwrite-2 pointer-events-none block w-fit select-none -rotate-3 _writeOn_85273a text-action-tertiary"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    step 2
                  </span>
                  <h3
                    class="text-subtitle-2"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    Go first
                  </h3>
                  <p
                    class="text-body-2 text-fg-secondary text-pretty"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    Ask your team how you’re doing. When you ask, it’s easier for everyone else to speak up.
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li
                  class="flex flex-col gap-1"
                >
                  <span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="font-handwrite text-subtitle-handwrite-2 pointer-events-none block w-fit select-none -rotate-3 _writeOn_85273a text-action-tertiary"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    step 3
                  </span>
                  <h3
                    class="text-subtitle-2"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    Run it yourself
                  </h3>
                  <p
                    class="text-body-2 text-fg-secondary text-pretty"
                    data-slot="text"
                  >
                    Invite new people, make a teammate an Admin, or turn off access for someone who has left.
                  </p>
                </li>
              </ol>
              <div
                class="flex flex-col items-center gap-5 border-border-subtle border-t pt-8 text-center"
